## Data Flow Summary

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant WH as Warehouse Owner
    participant UI as Add Product Page
    participant API as Warehouse API
    participant DB as Database

    WH->>UI: Clicks "+ Add" on Corn Flour row
    UI->>API: GET getBrandsAndVariants()
    API->>DB: Fetch brands + variant_options
    API-->>UI: Returns brands[], variantOptions[]
    
    WH->>UI: Fills form (name, brands, variants, prices)
    WH->>UI: Clicks "Create Product"
    
    UI->>API: POST createProduct(payload)
    API->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    API->>DB: INSERT product (createdByWarehouseId=userId)
    API->>DB: INSERT productBrand (for each brand)
    API->>DB: INSERT productVariantPrice (for each brand+variant)
    API->>DB: INSERT productVariant (auto-generated rows)
    API->>DB: INSERT inventory (one per variant, qty=0)
    API->>DB: COMMIT
    API-->>UI: { product: created }
    
    UI->>WH: Redirect to catalog with success toast
```

